      "description": "clean_data.py 使用规定 CLI 在原始输入上可回放，三份 JSON 均与 Judge 从输入独立重算的完整真值一致。",
      "weight": 9,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "factuality",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "method_params": {"execute_script": true, "outputs": 3},
      "score_cap_on_failure": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "R003",
      "description": "首次记录和后续重复记录同时变异后，脚本正确传播首次值、继续忽略后续重复值，并重算聚合与库存状态。",
      "weight": 10,
      "type": "hurdle",
      "dimension": "factuality",
      "method": "deterministic",
      "method_params": {"metamorphic_replay": "first_occurrence_and_later_duplicate"},
